      "marks_unanswered": 0,
      "question_text": "Sensitivity is?",
      "options": {
        "A": "TP/(TP+FP)",
        "B": "TP/(TP+FN)",
        "C": "TN/(TN+FP)",
        "D": "TN/(TN+FN)"
      },
      "correct_answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Sensitivity = TP/(TP+FN) = ability to detect disease (true positive rate). Specificity = TN/(TN+FP). High sensitivity → good screening test. High specificity → good confirmation test."
    },
