      "question_text": "NNT (number needed to treat) is calculated as?",
      "options": {
        "A": "RR",
        "B": "1/ARR",
        "C": "ARR × 100",
        "D": "1/RRR"
      },
      "correct_answer": "B",
      "explanation": "NNT = 1/ARR (absolute risk reduction). Lower NNT = more effective treatment. NNH (number needed to harm) = 1/ARI (absolute risk increase)."
